		"name": "Easy Split Postman Collection",
		"description": "Easy Split automates the splitting of payments with vendors and partners on time. Collect payments from customers, and set up a flexible schedule options to disburse payments to your vendors. Get detailed reports on the transactions, settlements, refunds, vendor payments and adjustments.\n\n**You can perform the following tasks using Easy Split:**\n\n- Add and manage all your vendors efficiently.\n    \n- Split payments and settle them into multiple vendor accounts using the available schedule options cycles.\n    \n- Check on-demand vendor balance and settle the money into the vendor accounts instantly.\n    \n- Vendor reconciliation.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "25503897"
	},
